  "sentences": [
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Pardon me",
          "phraseIds": [
            "pardon-me"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " teacher, could you please "
        },
        {
          "text": "repeat",
          "phraseIds": [
            "repeat-once-more"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "repeat"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " once more",
          "phraseIds": [
            "repeat-once-more"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " for our class?"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "不好意思老師，您可以為全班再重複說一次嗎？",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/asking-teacher-clarification/1.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "387cf9f0a54f0e62866ceb977dfdbe89c69025fecc1ae9ebd4d3f7936fc69bda",
        "sha256": "ac670118c48ce73c17e0bd71380f8ae9c634b9fca159855aa358aa0b230b775c"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I did not "
        },
        {
          "text": "hear",
          "wordIds": [
            "hear"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " clearly because there was some outside street noise."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "我剛才沒有聽得很清楚，因為外面馬路上有些雜音干擾。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/asking-teacher-clarification/2.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "dc77711339de6ccc4a3db0c771811873b1c02c3cc729b1e7506437f16f9436cc",
        "sha256": "720c8073fe5831cfc77be1f612e9fc28234c159fa9a12ed29b6c84c441701650"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Of course Leo, it is good to "
        },
        {
          "text": "raise your hand",
          "phraseIds": [
            "raise-your-hand"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " to ask questions."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "當然可以 Leo，主動舉手發問是很好的習慣。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/asking-teacher-clarification/3.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "303f8b917732d3a8757a2204538c9f61435a5e2ddb420a2f8455d9dfdd2ce140",
        "sha256": "54acf2d4ebaac000f32962f23e4bc9dc29fdaad0ad61bf538331acfd901d510d"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Could you explain step three a bit more "
        },
        {
          "text": "slowly",
          "wordIds": [
            "slowly"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " with a "
        },
        {
          "text": "clear",
          "wordIds": [
            "clear"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "example",
          "wordIds": [
            "example"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "?"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "可以請您放慢一點速度，用一個清晰的例子解釋第三個步驟嗎？",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/asking-teacher-clarification/4.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "f2c7f3066f1470b26d0a447bc104c049f838067f9f28adb544472263b0af200a",
        "sha256": "3affb2ae8cea6ea6c9092ff56b03a306ad8ac001234e40e0a381f649a971fe84"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "For ",
          "phraseIds": [
            "for-example"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "example",
          "phraseIds": [
            "for-example"
          ],
          "wordIds": [
            "example"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", when mixing the two liquids, stir them gently for one minute."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "舉例來說，當把兩種液體混合時，用攪拌棒輕輕攪拌一分鐘。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/asking-teacher-clarification/5.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "9ed8ab8e5579febab52573354e7ee861760e63138381c6bebcf89abf20cab55b",
        "sha256": "8950f0b4189b9f3c6ca2b9bc2b9a06128abb7d9fd8c1889a16ee1a62bbb370f9"
      }
    },
    {
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Now I completely "
        },
        {
          "text": "understand",
          "wordIds": [
            "understand"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " "
        },
        {
          "text": "what you mean",
          "phraseIds": [
            "what-you-mean"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", thank you very much."
        }
      ],
      "translation": "我現在完全明白老師您的意思了，非常謝謝您。",
      "audio": {
        "src": "/audio/sentences/asking-teacher-clarification/6.mp3",
        "voiceId": "kokoro-af-heart-v1",
        "textSha256": "27beacc1c6ba8bf1d93e7846d3b710dc3a4ba77b9502ad8bd846932a6cbf8ffd",
        "sha256": "f007053d4af7457d44f03933bf349e03e6ac479a67acced89538eb5cf2caf706"
      }
    }
  ]
